      "updated": 1789895804446,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "why we need to used data modeling?\n    (i)Data Redundancy\n             -> you just increase the data size \n                name     product\n                rohan     xyz\n                rohan     qwe\n                rohan      zbc\n                in this case you just increase the data size\n    (ii)Query Performance\n    (iii)Scaliblity and Maintance\n            -> database have frequent changes so its very difficult\n                to maintain data if we dont using data modeling",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "why we need to used data modeling?\n    (i)Data Redundancy\n             -> you just increase the data size \n                name     product\n                rohan     xyz\n                rohan     qwe\n                rohan      zbc\n                in this case you just increase the data size\n    (ii)Query Performance\n    (iii)Scaliblity and Maintance\n            -> database have frequent changes so its very difficult\n                to maintain data if we dont using data modeling",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6Z9RIcWV6H0c-5pKyaw9H",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141.1640625,
      "y": 411.64453125,
      "width": 454.7835998535156,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
