      "updated": 1789896034231,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is DataModeling?\n    DataModeling is a technique to convert your data into\n    kind of organized structure.  \n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is DataModeling?\n    DataModeling is a technique to convert your data into\n    kind of organized structure.  \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wuZgfKHXwR4T2o0rQn_J5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 90.5703125,
      "y": 504.7734375,
      "width": 551.66357421875,
      "height": 240,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1961887739,
      "version": 1006,
      "versionNonce": 1264164469,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789898435079,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Layers of DataModeling?\n    (i) Conceptual layer (requirement geathering)\n            -> In this layer your team leader communicate with client \n                and then they understand what they want and then they\n                they decide what we need to build\n            ->  In simple term they listen to clint then they understand \n                 what we need to build\n \n  (ii) Logical Layer\n            -> In this we can build Logic\n                Like:- Entity relationship\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Layers of DataModeling?\n    (i) Conceptual layer (requirement geathering)\n            -> In this layer your team leader communicate with client \n                and then they understand what they want and then they\n                they decide what we need to build\n            ->  In simple term they listen to clint then they understand \n                 what we need to build\n \n  (ii) Logical Layer\n            -> In this we can build Logic\n                Like:- Entity relationship\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
