      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789902883013,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "System should record order placed by a customer.\nEach order should store the orders\n\nSubject: Order\n\ncharcterstics:\n    order id\n    order date\n    total amount\n    Qty\n \nRelationship:\n    \n    A customers can place many orders\n    An orders can belongs to exactly one customer\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "System should record order placed by a customer.\nEach order should store the orders\n\nSubject: Order\n\ncharcterstics:\n    order id\n    order date\n    total amount\n    Qty\n \nRelationship:\n    \n    A customers can place many orders\n    An orders can belongs to exactly one customer\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
