      "text": "The company operates multiple stores branchs that\nprocess the customer orders\n\nSubjects: Store Branch\n\ncharcterstics:\n    store branch id\n    store branch name\n    store branch locations\n\n\nRelationships:\n    A store branch can process many orders\n    An order can process by one store branch\n",
