      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789903539919,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The system should records payments details for customer orders\n\nSubject: Payments\n\ncharcterstics:\n    payments id\n    payment methods\n    payment amounts\n    payment status\n    transaction timestamp\n\nRelationships:\n    An orders can have one or more payments\n    A payments belongs to one orders",
