      "text": "The system should track shipment information\nfor customer orders\n\nSubject: Shipment\n\ncharcterstics:\n    shipment id\n    shipping carries\n    Tracking number\n    shipments status\n    estimated delaviry date\n\nRelationships:\n    An order can have one or more shipments\n    A shipments belongs to one orders",
