      "text": "Numeric Data type\n    -> INT  (-2Billion to 2Billion) \n    -> BIGINT (More then 2 Billion)\n    -> Float\n    -> Double\n    -> Numeric(p,s) { p -> total number of digit\n                         s -> number after decimal }\n         Example:- 10.123456789 (p,s) => Numeric(11,9) ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Numeric Data type\n    -> INT  (-2Billion to 2Billion) \n    -> BIGINT (More then 2 Billion)\n    -> Float\n    -> Double\n    -> Numeric(p,s) { p -> total number of digit\n                         s -> number after decimal }\n         Example:- 10.123456789 (p,s) => Numeric(11,9) ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
